    },
    {
      "claim": "Emtricitabine, the closest supplied analog, has measured absolute oral bioavailability of 92% fasted, 93% in multiple reports, 75% as an oral solution, 58-97% overall, 73±6% in monkeys, 90±8% in rats, and 92% in a fixed-dose combination, all far above 20%.",
      "card_ids": ["C19", "C31", "C01", "C05", "C10", "C13", "C18", "C22", "C30"]
    },
