  "decision_summary": "High: the stavudine-like thymine dideoxynucleoside is supported by multiple transferable absolute-bioavailability measurements in closely related pyrimidine dideoxynucleosides (emtricitabine, lamivudine, zalcitabine), all above 20%, including new L2 records (emtricitabine 92% in fixed-dose combo, 90±8% in rats, lamivudine 93±15% and 86±17%, zalcitabine 30% in mice); no transferable evidence supports F<20%; physicochemical prior is favorable."
}

